# TOOLS

Tools are executable snippets for this vault.
Define each tool as a level-3 heading and one `sh` code block.

### vault-status
Show current vault status.
```sh
bashcorrect vault status
```

### list-entities
List entity pages in this vault.
```sh
ls -1 entities/*.md 2>/dev/null || true
```

### find-copilot-notes
Search notes that mention copilot.
```sh
grep -Rin "copilot" .
```
